```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Create Chats</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f1f2f6;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 450px;
            background-color: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        h2 {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            color: #222;
        }

        form {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        label {
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #444;
        }

        input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px 14px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 15px;
            outline: none;
        }

        input:focus {
            border-color: #555;
        }

        button {
            margin-top: 10px;
            padding: 12px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            background-color: #222;
            color: white;
            font-size: 16px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        button:hover {
            background-color: #444;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="container">

        <h2>💬 Create New Chat</h2>

        <form action="/create" method="post">

            <div>
                <label>From</label>
                <input type="text" name="from" placeholder="Enter sender name">
            </div>

            <div>
                <label>To</label>
                <input type="text" name="to" placeholder="Enter receiver name">
            </div>

            <div>
                <label>Message</label>
                <input type="text" name="msg" placeholder="Enter your message">
            </div>

            <div>
            </div>

            <button type="submit">Create Chat</button>

        </form>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
```
